35,2,1,talk,Servas,,"The technicians are gone, but the glasshouse crew remains. We have the hands, yet the minds are abroad.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"My findings show computing is free, but animal-unit day rates spiked. Travel costs are frozen, yet shipping climbed.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,The closeout files confirm my suspicion. Catalogue awards persist; mechanism-focused ones stall. We should value sustained utility.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Takumi,,"Wow, the spectroscopy suite was idle for eleven weeks! That’s scary. One engineer for three institutes?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
